{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>the fat that covers the innards</b> — since it comes to atone for the sin he committed on account of his excess fat, as written: שמנת עבית כשית (you grew fat, you grew thick, you grew gorged), and written: וישמן ישורון ויבעט (Jeshurun grew fat and kicked). Therefore he brings the fat, as though he offered his own fat."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:19:42.860666315Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}